  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa, Latin America and Caribbean Good Governance Course - Short Term Training Scholarship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to deliver Good Governance&#xa0;modules to cohorts of up to 30 scholars from English speaking-partners in the Africa (AFR), Latin America and Caribbean (LAC) regions from October 2022.
These modules were piloted with Pacific and ASEAN scholars in 2021 and 2022 and have been adapted for both regions to reflect regional development priorities, knowledge and regional institutions of influence.</narrative>
  </description>
